1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,160
So I tried dividing Workflow Nodes into two groups.

2
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:11,040
The first group is Logic Nodes, like Branch and Loop.

3
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,960
They control the flow.

4
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:15,960
The second group is Action Nodes.

5
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:18,360
They do the actual work.

6
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:22,800
Action Nodes can then be divided into Agent Nodes and Task Nodes.
